      "type": "title",
      "value": "Ritual of the Wandering Wizard"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This ritual will open a portal and summon a walker of the planes, a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandering Wizard",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " that will trade with you for various magical wares. \n\nAn experienced traveller, he has access to all of the patterns needed for manaweaving as well as the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of Locating",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Well, most of the locations.  There are locations that even this experienced traveler won't share, out of fear of retribution from the various magical factions.  However, rumors tell of a very powerful creature that harbors no such fear and will deal in these locations in exchange for theses of rote knowledge. "
        },
        {
          "text": "The Wandering Wizard will only remain for a minute before continuing on his journey.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
